","title":"Reading · A short story and play excerpt","blocks":[{"type":"text","title":"The Garden That Was Worth Waiting For","paras":["Grandpa planted a tree and said, “It’s **worth waiting**.” Years passed. “It’s **no use watching** it grow,” laughed Dina. But one spring the tree bloomed. “See? It **was worth** the wait!”","She sat under it and thought: some things are **worth doing** slowly."],"kicker":"SHORT STORY","by":"Original story","gloss":[]}]},{"tag":"Compreensão","title":"Did you understand?","blocks":[{"type":"tfng","title":"","items":[{"q":"Grandpa planted a tree.","ans":"T","why":"planted a tree."},{"q":"The tree never bloomed.","ans":"F","why":"bloomed."},{"q":"Dina thought things are worth doing slowly.","ans":"T","why":"worth doing slowly."}]},{"type":"mcq","title":"Vocabulary in context","items":[{"q":"“bloom” = ?","opts":["florescer","sangrar","soprar"],"ans":0,"why":"bloom."},{"q":"“wait” = ?","opts":["esperar","pesar","ganhar"],"ans":0,"why":"wait."}]}]},{"tag":"Gramática","title":"worth e no use em histórias","blocks":[{"type":"table","head":["Estrutura","Exemplo"],"rows":[["worth + -ing","**It’s worth waiting.**"],["no use + -ing","**It’s no use watching it grow.**"],["was worth the wait","**It was worth the wait!**"],["worth doing slowly","**some things are worth doing slowly**"]],"cap":"worth e no use em histórias"},{"type":"box","kind":"look","t":"Regra","body":"**worth the wait / the effort / the price / the trip** são colocações comuns."}]},{"tag":"Prática","title":"Practice","blocks":[{"type":"gap","title":"Complete the sentences","bank":null,"items":[{"s":"It’s worth ___ . (wait -ing)","a":"waiting","why":"worth + -ing."},{"s":"It’s no use ___ it grow. (watch -ing)","a":"watching","why":"no use + -ing."},{"s":"It was worth the ___ . (wait)","a":"wait","why":"colocação."},{"s":"The tree ___ in spring. (bloom, past)","a":"bloomed","why":"Past Simple."}]},{"type":"match","title":"Match the word to its meaning","pairs":[["old tree","árvore